flowchart LR
    subgraph Inputs[Immutable inputs]
        HFT[HftBacktest local-arrival states]
        NT[Nautilus market-data objects]
        DATA[Manifest-admitted Tardis and local data]
        RAW[Continuous raw and normalized BTC capture]
        POLICY[Frozen validation and promotion policies]
    end

    RAW --> READY[Latest-chain duration quality and storage readiness]
    POLICY --> READY
    READY -->|prerequisite only| DATA

    HFT --> KERNEL[Shared causal market-state contract]
    NT --> KERNEL
    KERNEL --> FEATURES[Incremental bounded feature engine]
    FEATURES --> MM[Avellaneda-Stoikov kernel]
    FEATURES --> SCALPER[Order-flow scalper kernel]
    FEATURES --> PARQUET[Immutable feature Parquet plus manifest]
    PARQUET --> MATRIX[Plan-bound development matrix without holdout rows]
    PARQUET --> FAMILY[Predeclared no-selection scalping horizon audit]
    PARQUET --> NOSIGNAL[Bounded neutral-alpha kernel replay]

    DATA --> REPLAY[Offline tick replay]
    REPLAY --> KERNEL
    MATRIX --> FEAS[Training-only optimistic target-feasibility ceiling]
    FAMILY --> MATRIX
    FAMILY --> FEAS
    POLICY --> FAMILY
    FEAS --> SEARCH[Bounded validation-only search]
    POLICY --> FEAS
    SEARCH --> LGB[LightGBM reference]
    SEARCH --> XGB[XGBoost CPU challenger]
    SEARCH --> CAT[CatBoost challenger]

    LGB --> NATIVE[Native-format artifact plus schema and lineage hashes]
    XGB --> NATIVE
    CAT --> NATIVE
    NATIVE --> CONTROL[Repeated relative randomized-label control]
    NATIVE --> REGIME[Causal semantic volatility-regime report]
    NATIVE --> ECONOMIC[Non-overlapping scenario cost replay]
    NOSIGNAL --> CONTROL
    REGIME --> CONTROL
    ECONOMIC --> CONTROL
    POLICY --> CONTROL
    CONTROL --> GATES[Champion-challenger gates]
    MM --> GATES
    SCALPER --> GATES

    GATES --> REGISTRY[(Single-writer DuckDB registry)]
    REGISTRY --> AUTO[Automation stage transitions]
    AUTO --> WAIT[AWAITING_APPROVAL]
    WAIT -->|human approval required| CANARY[APPROVED_CANARY]

    FEATURES --> DRIFT[Feature drift report]
    DRIFT --> GATES
    GATES --> METRICS[Bounded Prometheus metrics]
    READY --> METRICS
    METRICS --> DASH[Research governance dashboard]

    classDef hard fill:#5b1a1a,color:#fff,stroke:#ff6b6b,stroke-width:2px;
    class WAIT,CANARY hard;
